# Salvi-attack-oteska.lic
# Bigshot custom attack routine for Salvi (Cleric) on the Oteska / Miasmal Forest hunt, where the
# targets are a mix of undead and living. Drop it into a bigshot hunting-commands list as a single
# command:
#
#   script Salvi-attack-oteska
#
# It makes no attack decisions of its own. It looks at what bigshot is fighting and hands the pass
# to the routine Salvi already uses for that kind of target:
#
#   undead  (greater moor wight, greater fetid corpse, luminous spectre)
#           -> Salvi-attack.lic      Prayer of Holding (301), then Condemn (309)
#   living  (swamp hag, greater bog troll)
#           -> Salvi-attack-web.lic  Web (118), then Condemn (309)
#
# Everything else -- mana gates, FUMBLE retries, the Condemn charge bank, Censure on a fresh group
# pull of living targets, Symbol of Mana, wand fallback, wound handling, resting out of wands -- is
# whatever those two scripts do, unchanged. A name that isn't on the undead list is treated as living
# (Web works on anything; 301 only works on undead, so a wrong guess that way is the safe one).
#
# The one thing added here is the target settle. bigshot (priority: true) swaps to a new target by
# sending `target #id` and starting this script in the same breath, while XMLData.current_target_id
# trails the game. Picko-attack-oteska cast the wrong element at a swamp hag that way on 11/10. Here
# the risk is the wrong SPELL (301 on a living hag does nothing), and both routines cast with the
# implicit target (`incant 301`, `incant 118`, `incant 309`), so the target is read until it holds
# and re-sent if the game's target isn't the one being fought before handing off.
#
# ecleanse: pause list needs bigshot, eloot, wander, and ALL THREE of Salvi-attack-oteska,
# Salvi-attack and Salvi-attack-web -- the two routines run as children of this one, and pausing
# the parent does not pause a child.

# --- patterns -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Undead by name. The Oteska hunt only meets the first three; the rest keep it right if the profile
# is ever pointed at another ground.
UNDEAD_NAME = /\b(?:wights?|corpses?|spectres?|specters?|zombies?|skeletons?|skeletal|ghouls?|ghosts?|wraiths?|mummy|mummies|revenants?|liches|lich|vampires?|banshees?|phantoms?|apparitions?|poltergeists?)\b/i unless defined?(UNDEAD_NAME)

# --- helpers --------------------------------------------------------------------------

def undead_foe?(foe)
  foe.name.to_s =~ UNDEAD_NAME ? true : false
end

# Same death check as the two routines: GameObj status, "dead" while the corpse lingers, then "gone".
def target_dead?(foe)
  return true if foe.nil?
  return true if foe.status.to_s =~ /dead|gone/
  !GameObj.targets.any? { |t| t.id.to_i == foe.id.to_i && t.status.to_s !~ /dead|gone/ }
end

# The creature bigshot has targeted, else the first live one in the room.
def current_foe
  foe = GameObj.targets.find { |t| t.id.to_i == XMLData.current_target_id.to_i } if XMLData.current_target_id
  foe || GameObj.targets.find { |t| t.status.to_s !~ /dead|gone/ && t.name !~ /animated/ }
end

# --- main -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

foe = current_foe

# Nothing live to hit. Clear Salvi-attack-web's once-per-pull Censure flag the way that script does
# when it is run with no live target, otherwise Censure would only ever fire once per Lich session.
if target_dead?(foe)
  $salvi_censure_done = false
  exit
end

waitrt?
waitcastrt?

# Let the game's target catch up with bigshot's swap (max 3 reads, 0.5 s apart), then follow it.
3.times do
  sleep 0.5
  latest = current_foe
  break if latest.nil? || latest.id.to_i == foe.id.to_i
  foe = latest
end

if target_dead?(foe)
  $salvi_censure_done = false
  exit
end

fput "target ##{foe.id}" unless XMLData.current_target_id.to_i == foe.id.to_i

if undead_foe?(foe)
  echo "#{foe.name}: undead -- 301 then 309" unless $salvi_oteska_last_id == foe.id.to_i
  $salvi_oteska_last_id = foe.id.to_i
  Script.run("Salvi-attack")
else
  echo "#{foe.name}: living -- 118 then 309" unless $salvi_oteska_last_id == foe.id.to_i
  $salvi_oteska_last_id = foe.id.to_i
  Script.run("Salvi-attack-web")
end
